      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/25/us/politics/collins-jackson-maine-senate-fundraising.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[共和党人通过亿万富翁资助的超级政治行动委员会网络向缅因州参议员投入巨额资金。特洛伊·杰克逊被选为新的民主党候选人，他还有很多工作要做。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/25/us/politics/collins-jackson-maine-senate-fundraising.html</guid>
